petrus-engine-file
Copyright 2026 Seasoned

This package is a Haskell port of the fileVersion 2 net file format of
petrus-engine (https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus-engine), pinned under
upstream/petrus-engine: its schema models, multi-file loader, canonical JSON
writer and format CLI. Its differential tests also run the file I/O code of
petrus-viewer (https://github.com/henriquebastos/petrus-viewer), pinned under
upstream/petrus-viewer, which carries the same license and copyright.
